wait 1

play "chaos_loop.ogg" 0.0 loop
volume "chaos_loop.ogg" 0.4 27.0

play "exploding_b.ogg" 0.8

wait 5.5

play "NoComingBack.ogg" 0.5 loop

wait 7

say "The floor between all three breaks utterly. A gust sweeps the young girl away;
behind great stones. The blade hilt drops from the hand of a god...
And the guardian shudders as her gaze, and the earth, begin to fall toward the Void."

play "exploding_a.ogg" 0.7
wait 1.6 clear
play "sword_call.ogg" 0.8

say "Utter cacophony bombards them.
Saya calls her blade from her body, and it now listens.
Weak, she nearly falls. She thrusts the sword down to the earth to stay."

stop "chaos_loop.ogg" 3

play "chaos_loop_muffled.ogg" 0 loop
volume "chaos_loop_muffled.ogg" 0.5 4.0

say "The sound begins to dull around her. She assumes this to be death.
Light and shadow are being cast everywhere
in the tumult of the collapsing place."

say "But she realizes: she has kept her cognizance.
The sound has dulled for another reason...
Insight stands a ways from her, gazing down on the guardian."

play "collapse.ogg" 1
play "sword_draw_delayed.ogg" 0.7

hidetextbox

wait 5

show "catastrophe/cat_8_1_1.jpg" 1:1 1:1 0.7:0.7 fade(9,linear) normal
move "catastrophe/cat_8_1_1.jpg" 300:0 50 sineout

wait 3
wait 2 clear

say "...Saya forces herself to stand, drawing the sword up again.
Insight merely tells her,
\"There's little time left for you.\""

say "\"Enough, surely,\" Saya replies, \"to keep that child safe, then.\""

say "\"You...\" Insight mutters. \"You had your god's favor.
Have you not wished for power since you first woke up?\""

show "catastrophe/cat_8_1.jpg" 0.5:0.4 0.5:0.4 0.71:0.71 fade(1.5,linear) normal
move "catastrophe/cat_8_1.jpg" -50:0 0 sineout
wait 0
move "catastrophe/cat_8_1.jpg" 50:0 12 sineout

show "white50.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.05,linear) normal

wait 0.05

hide "white50.png" fade(1,linear)

wait 0.15

show "white70.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.05,linear) normal

wait 0.05
hide "white70.png" fade(5,linear)

play "sword_drop.ogg" 1

say "Saya doesn't promptly answer...
She falls, dropping to the sword, and is kept half-standing by its guard.
There, voice hoarse, she replies."

say "\"True, I am the fool.
No different from any person who's loved another.
And I haven't believed in a better ending...for quite some time.\""

say "\"But...give me your name,\" Saya bids.
\"Last words to someone that I 'know'; at least dignify me that.\""

say "\"...I am Lacrymira.\""

play "earthquake_tremor.ogg" 0.7

say "\"Lacrymira...\" Saya repeats. The earth quakes.
Her breath haggard, she tells the god: \"I have only ever had one wish.
I wished for a new land.\""

say "And as Saya speaks...
two gods listen."

show "catastrophe/cat_8_1_2.jpg" 0.5:0.65 0.5:0.65 1:1 fade(3,linear) normal
move "catastrophe/cat_8_1_2.jpg" -300:0 50 sineout

say "\"That what ruins surrounded us all,
were signs of what to run from. And those memories surrounding:
examples to uphold.\""

say "A deep thing comes up to better hear,
and it comes to turn strongly nearby...
...above a shaken Vita."

say "\"I will not give up on here, or anyone, and never her.
Not even with all lights dead.
I would take hands in the dark, and help them to a new land.\""

show "catastrophe/cat_8_2_1.jpg" 1:1 1:1 0.7:0.7 fade(3,linear) normal

say "\"You may take my words, may forget them perhaps...
But no matter the cost. No matter the grief.
I want something better for all of them.\""

show "catastrophe/cat_8_2_2.png" 0:0.5 0:0.5 0.7:0.7 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.05,linear) normal

wait 0.05

hide "white.png" fade(1,linear)

play "ring.ogg" 0.9
play "shimmer_loop.ogg" 0.0 loop
volume "chaos_loop_muffled.ogg" 0.2 3.0
volume "shimmer_loop.ogg" 0.8 5.0

say "At these words, power suddenly bursts down over Vita. She feels a warmth and brief comfort.
With the winds growing too bright to watch, and a ringing sound piercing her ears—
Vita lifts her body up."

hide "catastrophe/cat_8_1.jpg" fade(0,linear)

show "catastrophe/cat_8_2_3.png" 0:0.5 0:0.5 0.7:0.7 fade(2,linear) normal
show "2white50.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(10,linear) normal

say "Through the shaking and jolting of the world, Vita begins to cry...
Above her, glass and wind begin to coalesce, and light flows slowly out the spiral."

show "catastrophe/cat_8_3_1.jpg" 1:0 1:0 0.62:0.62 fade(3,linear) normal
move "catastrophe/cat_8_3_1.jpg" 150:0 25 sineout
show "2white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.05,linear) normal

wait 0.05

hide "2white.png" fade(4,linear)

play "heartbeatB.ogg" 1.0

say "The child watches, still...
as her hair dashes around her face. She watches something take form,
and her heart pounds fiercely through her chest."

show "catastrophe/cat_8_3_2.jpg" 1:1 1:1 0.71:0.71 fade(0.1,linear) normal
move "catastrophe/cat_8_3_2.jpg" 75:0 13 sineout


show "3white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.05,linear) normal

wait 0.05 clear

hide "3white.png" fade(4,linear)

wait 3.95

stop "shimmer_loop.ogg" 1
play "folding_in.ogg" 0.6

say "Light and reality's fabric both fold inward above her. She hears a voice again—
and with strength, she stands at its bidding
reaching up over her hand, and taking hold of what is there."

hidetextbox
wait 2
show "2white70.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(3,linear) normal
wait 2

show "black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(4,linear) normal
wait 6
unload_textures
wait 0
show "catastrophe/cat_8_1.jpg" 0.5:0.4 0.5:0.4 0.7:0.7 fade(9,linear) normal
wait 2

say "She makes her face firm
as her fingers clasp around it: a round kind of shape and then—
Saya's words nearby begin to reach her ears through everything."

say "\"And it may be selfish...
But, at least, I want her to find a better place than this.\""

hide "catastrophe/cat_8_1.jpg" fade(0.2,linear)

play "step_jump.ogg" 0.6

wait 1 clear
play "exploding_b.ogg" 0.6

stop "chaos_loop_muffled.ogg" 2.0
play "chaos_loop.ogg" 0.0 loop
volume "chaos_loop.ogg" 0.4 1.0

say "Before Saya, Insight makes to answer, but she falters at the sight of a child
leaping down to the earth before her. Her control escapes
and sound rushes back in."

say "Memory fills her sight for an instant.
Remembering, Insight remains still; heart beating."

play "footstepsCFast.ogg" 1.0
wait 1 clear
play "clothingRustleC.ogg" 0.75

show "catastrophe/cat_8_4_1.jpg" 0:0.7 0:0.7 0.83:0.83 fade(1,linear) normal
move "catastrophe/cat_8_4_1.jpg" -500:0 0.7 sineout

wait 0.7 clear
move "catastrophe/cat_8_4_1.jpg" -50:0 5 outquad
wait 2.4

say "Vita runs to Saya, falls to her.
She grips at the woman's clothes with one hand
as a light shines vibrantly in her other."

say "\"Saya!\" Vita screams. \"What were you doing!? Why did you—!?\""

show "5black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(2,linear) normal

say "\"Wait,\" Saya bids, and she lifts a hand to Vita's crying face.
She holds it steady, and with a smile she tells her: \"You look like an idiot.\"
—Suddenly, the earth breaks again, and winds rush out."

play "exploding_a.ogg" 0.7

wait 4 clear

show "catastrophe/cat_8_4_2.jpg" 1:1 1:1 1:1 fade(2.5,linear) normal

wait 5

say "And now, knowing she will die,
knowing that she will not see this face again,
Saya's smile falls away."

play "ominous_swell.ogg" 1
show "catastrophe/cat_8_4.jpg" 0.5:0 0.5:0 0.7:0.7 fade(2.5,linear) normal
move "catastrophe/cat_8_4.jpg" 0:-100 20 sineout

say "A grimace meets the grown woman's face,
and tears fast begin to fall."

say "\"Please don't...!\" Vita pleads with her.
\"You absolutely can't...!\"
Swiftly, Saya brings her arms tight—as tight as she is able around Vita."

show "4black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(1,linear) normal

say "As her voice shakes, Saya tells her charge:
\"Don't show your back to anything.
Don't fear anything.\""

say "\"No!\"
Shouting, Vita holds her much more tightly."

say "\"Don't forget that you're capable.
If you're ever lost, look to the sky and find yourself again.\""

say "\"Saya...!\""

show "catastrophe/cat_8_5_0.jpg" 0.6:1 0.6:1 0.7:0.7 fade(1,linear) normal
wait 1 clear

hide "catastrophe/cat_8_1_1.jpg" fade(0.1,linear)
